    slug: "karriere-website-oder-recruiting-app",
    title: "Mobile Karriere-Seite statt App: Was Personalberatungen wirklich brauchen",
    seoTitle: "Karriere-Seite statt App: Was Beratungen brauchen | ShortSelect",
    date: "2024-11-25",
